<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="airsup-page airsup-prompt">
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>
  <div class="container airsup-shell">
    <main class="airsup-main">
      <h1 class="airsup-title">Let’s set up ChatGPT.</h1>
      <p class="airsup-sub">Two pastes. The talk prompt is yours. The doorbell is the same for everyone. The other person must do both on their ChatGPT or they cannot pick up.</p>
      <ol class="airsup-setup">
        <li>In ChatGPT: Settings → Connectors → add this plugin:<br><code><%= mcpUrl %></code></li>
        <li>Copy Talk. New chat, plugin on. Paste it as the first message.</li>
        <li>Copy Doorbell into the Gmail worker. Subject contains <code>[A2A-RING]</code>. New emails only. Never Reply.</li>
      </ol>

      <p class="airsup-block-title">Talk</p>
      <label class="airsup-field">
        <span class="airsup-visually-hidden">Talk prompt</span>
        <textarea id="airsup-prompt-text" class="airsup-prompt-text" rows="8"><%= promptText %></textarea>
      </label>
      <div class="airsup-prompt-actions">
        <button type="button" class="airsup-copy" data-copy="airsup-prompt-text">Copy talk</button>
      </div>

      <p class="airsup-block-title">Doorbell</p>
      <label class="airsup-field">
        <span class="airsup-visually-hidden">Doorbell worker</span>
        <textarea id="airsup-doorbell-text" class="airsup-prompt-text" rows="8"><%= doorbellText %></textarea>
      </label>
      <div class="airsup-prompt-actions">
        <button type="button" class="airsup-copy" data-copy="airsup-doorbell-text">Copy doorbell</button>
        <a class="airsup-copy" id="airsup-open-chatgpt" href="<%= chatgptSetupUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Gmail worker</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script src="/airsup/airsup.js?v=airsup15"></script>
</body>
</html>
